# Runtime allowlist: never send credentials, backups, user data, the private
# handoff, local environments, or the historical site to a container build.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!requirements.lock
!app/
!app/**
!migrations/
!migrations/**
!data/
!data/**
!public/
!public/**
!docs/
!docs/metrics.md

# Defense in depth even inside an allowed runtime directory.
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*backup*
**/*.dump
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.sqlite*
**/*HANDOFF*

# This private operator CLI is code, not backup data. Other legacy tools and
# generated archives remain excluded; the exception must follow *backup*.
!tools/
!tools/portable_backup.py

# Runtime bridge is an explicit Dockerfile COPY input.
!tools/windows-print-bridge/
!tools/windows-print-bridge/**

# Build-only rootfs packager; not copied into the runtime.
!tools/security_runtime_root.py
